  "preamble": "Deretroflexion turning the retroflex approximant [ɻ] into an alveolar rhotic. In Tulu, Proto-Dravidian *ɻ (ḻ) became ḷ in the Brahman dialects and r in the others, so Proto-Dravidian *tāẓ 'palmyra' gives Tulu tāri where Kannada has tāḷe.",
